    '01-02': ["In Japan, New Year games include sugoroku, fukuwarai and karuta! Which do you like?"],
    '01-03': ["The New Year holidays end today in Japan. Don't eat too many rice cakes!"],
    '01-05': ["In Japan, January 5th is Go Day: 1 and 5 can be read \"i-go\"!"],
    '01-07': ["In Japan, today people eat rice porridge with seven spring herbs. Can you name them?"],
    '01-11': ["In Japan, today is Kagami-biraki: the hard New Year rice cakes are broken and eaten in sweet soup."],
    '01-2Mo': ["In Japan, today is Coming of Age Day. Congratulations to everyone who became an adult!"],
    '02-03': ["Around now it's Setsubun in Japan! \"Demons out, luck in!\" You eat as many beans as your age."],
    '02-11': ["In Japan, today is National Foundation Day, a public holiday."],
